    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Diigheanyeew damanamughuush",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoamughuush Musa fuga sean bea Israeli ak gwayeesha, “Ea Israeli, ooleeysiina iit diigheanyeeka ea deaweedajeega earukuneegwa askweareani, oanaala geat ak gooshageachi geat ak goosinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA gwasinuuneasa neajeeda aba uhuuda giijeeda Horebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea NG'UTAMIIDA ea masinudayi neajeeni ghweanigaasa, gwasin niny ea aseaseeni sindi hiji duu eendana ghamneawean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA gabalool aba madeedeang'wa aba uhuuda giijeeda, nea gwarina ghuutaanyi bugusta beasta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean ghaamiinaadi aba damandida aba bugusteang'wa agooga ea NG'UTAMIIDA darukuneegwa digheanyeeka NG'UTAMIIDA; ghoabealeagwa beasta mida uhuuda giijeeda ak ea meadiyeesiini uhuuda giijeeda. Hean gwayi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Aniini NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gil, earuuneeweey ng'eanyiida Misri, jeeda gheeda soomjeandumeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Adiidu gindeawi aseecheeka suuk, geeghus aniini gicha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
