        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Sisiina mureeda gweanu ea geamadu gawuurji gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ak abeeda gayghoahaada eawoojigaagu, ak nea gaynyagaada aba ng'eanyiida goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U.",
          "type": "text",
