        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Adiidu gishisi ghaang' gatmooda gischeewoocheandaang'u nea adiidu gishisi ghaang' gheeda gischeewoocheandaang'u ghana ea madamnyeandaanyi gil, ghana ea soomjeandaanyi was ng'eedeeda gil ghana ea soomjeandaanyi was gatmooda, ea heeydaanyi ghana ea digeadaanyi ghana ea gilinyoo gwandeawa sean.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
