            "verseId": "DEU.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'asheesu goobaloolaneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA aba guuyeedeang'wa sean aba uhuuda giijeeda aba bugusta beasta, ea shamooghooda, ea misaneeda haw nea goojuuri, ak ea meahaada gil nuut. Ak gang'oorsa badayda beehaji iyeenya bea lagheanga ak gagoonan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muuwda buuneeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ata ghwayiiy NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheegeagwa damanda sibalooldi aniini ea agooga; ak gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Naayiinyi ghuusigeaba fiisu, ak ghoadoabiiw rukunooda ng'asheesu sean rugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanyawa inyas gwandeawa gurooruunatka uurji nih ea ghoah galeagasean, jea ghoawal gheang'deanyu gaygwasinnean mureeda ea diigheanyeekeasu sean, ak abeeda gayghwanyas giibinda miy saawa ea diibiga nyaawa damanda manda muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Una biikta ak giyeeshi, “Abiikta jeeda maheemajeegeagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i miinaada aba hiji bea murdeedeanyuun ak gaydarukuneey digheanyeeka sean ea deaweedajeega ea huumeanyeeka jea anaala saawa, ak abeeda gaygwasissa mureeda aba ng'eanyiida aadawji jea goombal.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi shageada ak gisini gidarukuneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, nea adiidu gooyamsi geat geatinda dugwa ghana geatinda ghaadaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayaada naweadinga sean rukuneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA, ak abeeda gajanyasa eaweega, nea gajanyasa giibinda miy, ak abeeda gajoopiidana gweanyeeka saang'a aba ng'eanyiida jea oombaliischeewana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
